      ],
      "source": "https://www.pilotpointtx.gov/224/History-of-Pilot-Point"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In autumn 1880, the first Texas and Pacific Railroad train rolled through Pilot Point, linking it to the expanding rail network.",
